OL,3,GNEWSALibrary visits rise by 6% to
OL,4,Aalmost 2m
OL,5,
OL,6,FAlmost two million trips have been made
OL,7,Fto North Yorkshire libraries in a year,
OL,8,Fa 6% increase on the previous period,
OL,9,Fcouncil data shows.
OL,11,FThe 2025/26 review of the council's
OL,12,Flibraries found usage was on an upward
OL,13,Ftrend, as libraries increasingly
OL,14,Foperate as community hubs.
OL,16,FBut the number of book issues has
OL,17,Ffallen by 5% overall, compared to the
OL,18,F2024/25 period.
OL,23,APub: 17-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
