OL,4,Aalmost 2m
OL,5,
OL,6,FDigital borrowing continued to grow,
OL,7,Fwith eBook and eAudio issues increasing
OL,8,Fby 11%, and eMagazine and eNewspaper
OL,9,Fissues rising by 16%.
